Package: omicsDNA
Title: A Multilayer Network Toolkit for Grouped Omics and Other High-Dimensional Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mehran", "Piran", , "piranmehran@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7891-728X")),
    person("Abir", "Khazaal", , "a.khazaal@unsw.edu.au", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-0281-3932")),
    person("VafaeeLab", role = "cph"))
Description: Builds layered networks from grouped data (e.g., age groups or
    disease stages), stabilises edges via resampling and consensus, assembles a
    multilayer network object, detects and visualises communities, quantifies
    layer-wise structure, compares overlaps across layers, and produces static
    and dynamic visualisations with reproducible, timestamped outputs.
